                            <tr class="dataRow" width="100%"> <td width="70%">1. What is the process for establishing a parent fee hardship for a Colorado Works/TANF Family?(Current county policy/procedure must be submitted to the State Department for review and approval)</td><td width="30%">{!ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q1__c}</td><td width="70%;" style="color: {!IF(CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q1__c!= ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q1__c, 'red', 'black')}">{!CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q1__c}</td></tr>
