                            <tr class="dataRow" width="100%"> <td width="70%">2. Who makes the final determination for a parent fee hardship for a Colorado Works/TANF Family?</td><td width="30%">{!ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q3__c}</td><td width="70%;" style="color: {!IF(CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q3__c!= ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q3__c, 'red', 'black')}">{!CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q3__c}</td></tr>
                            <tr class="dataRow" width="100%"> <td width="70%">3. How many months are allowed per occurrence for a parent fee hardship for a Colorado Works/TANF Family? (Maximum is 6 months)</td><td width="30%">{!ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q4__c}</td><td width="70%;" style="color: {!IF(CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q4__c!= ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q4__c, 'red', 'black')}">{!CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q4__c}</td></tr>
                            <tr class="dataRow" width="100%"> <td width="70%">4. What is your county's policy/procedure for establishing a parent fee hardship for a Low-Income family? (Current county policy/procedure must be submitted to the State Department for review and approval)</td><td width="30%">{!ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q5__c}</td><td width="70%;" style="color: {!IF(CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q5__c!= ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q5__c, 'red', 'black')}">{!CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q5__c}</td></tr>
