                            <tr class="dataRow" width="100%"> <td width="70%">5. Who makes the final determination for a parent fee hardship for a Low-Income Family?</td><td width="30%">{!ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q7__c}</td><td width="70%;" style="color: {!IF(CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q7__c!= ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q7__c, 'red', 'black')}">{!CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q7__c}</td></tr>
                            <tr class="dataRow" width="100%"> <td width="70%">6. How many months are allowed per occurrence for a parent fee hardship for a Low-Income Family? (Maximum is 6 months)</td><td width="30%">{!ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q8__c}</td><td width="70%;" style="color: {!IF(CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q8__c!= ApprovedCountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q8__c, 'red', 'black')}">{!CountyRatePlan.PAYMENT_Q8__c}</td></tr>
                        </table> 
